          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Field Trip Permission review boundary",
          "guidance": "Permission applies only to the named trip, date, transportation plan, and activity scope recorded here. A material itinerary, supervision, or return change requires renewed guardian communication and authorized review. Record only field trip permission facts needed here. Route field trip permission policy review to assigned staff."
        }
